      }, {
        "text": "\n  delay(1000);\n}`;\n\nconst krumonDefaultCode \u003d `// KRUMON V."
      }, {
        "text": "130715 COMPATIBILITY MODE\n// Functions: fd(), bk(), sl(), sr(), ao(),"
      }, {
        "text": " motor(), analog(), beep(), sleep(), lcd()\n\nvoid main() {\n  lcd(\"Krumon Booted"
