      }, {
        "text": "8x64 OLED\u003cbr/\u003eOFFLINE\n                            \u003c/div\u003e\n                         \u003c/div\u003e\n                      )}\n                   \u003c/div\u003e"
      }, {
        "text": "\n                 ))}\n               \u003c/div\u003e\n            )}\n\n            \u003cdiv className\u003d{`bg-gray-50 dark:bg-neutral"
      }, {
        "text": "-800 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 dark:border-neutral-700"
      }, {
        "text": " p-2 flex flex-col justify-center gap-2 shadow-sm ${displayComponents.length \u003e 0"
      }, {
        "text": " ? \u0027shrink-0\u0027 : \u0027h-full\u0027}`}\u003e\n              \u003cbutton onClick\u003d{runSimulationCloud} disabled"
      }, {
        "text": "\u003d{isRunning} className\u003d{`flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-2 rounded"
      }, {
        "text": " font-bold text-[13px] transition-colors ${isRunning ? \u0027bg-gray-300 text"
      }, {
        "text": "-gray-500 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-gray-500"
      }, {
        "text": " cursor-not-allowed\u0027 : \u0027bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700"
      }, {
        "text": " text-white\u0027}`}\u003e\n                \u003cPlay size\u003d{14} fill\u003d\"currentColor\" /\u003e RUN (Cloud)"
      }, {
        "text": "\n              \u003c/button\u003e\n              {offlineHexCode \u0026\u0026 (\n                \u003cbutton onClick\u003d{runSimulationOffline} disabled\u003d{"
      }, {
        "text": "isRunning} className\u003d{`flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-1.5 px-2 rounded font"
      }, {
        "text": "-bold text-[13px] transition-colors ${isRunning ? \u0027bg-gray-300 text-"
      }, {
        "text": "gray-500 dark:bg-gray-700 dark:text-gray-500 cursor"
      }, {
        "text": "-not-allowed\u0027 : \u0027bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text"
      }, {
        "text": "-white\u0027}`} title\u003d{`Run ${offlineHexName}`}\u003e\n                  \u003cPlay size\u003d{14} fill\u003d\"currentColor"
      }, {
        "text": "\" /\u003e RUN (Local)\n                \u003c/button\u003e\n              )}\n              \u003cbutton onClick\u003d{stopSimulation} className"
      }, {
        "text": "\u003d\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-yellow-600 hover:bg-yellow-"
      }, {
        "text": "700 text-white py-1.5 px-2 rounded font-bold text-[13px]"
      }, {
        "text": " transition-colors\"\u003e\n                \u003cSquare size\u003d{14} fill\u003d\"currentColor\" /\u003e STOP\n              \u003c/button\u003e"
      }, {
        "text": "\n              \u003cbutton onClick\u003d{resetSimulation} className\u003d\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-red"
      }, {
        "text": "-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white py-1.5 px-2"
      }, {
        "text": " rounded font-bold text-[13px] transition-colors\"\u003e\n                \u003cRotateCcw size\u003d{14"
      }, {
        "text": "} /\u003e RESET\n              \u003c/button\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n          \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n      \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e"
      }, {
        "text": "\n  );\n}\n\nexport default App;\n```"
