      }, {
        "text": " wheel stops, the other goes forwards).\n\nSince our simple virtual DC Motor components only use a single pin and move in"
      }, {
        "text": " one direction when `HIGH`, the physical result of `sl()` and `tl()` will visually look the same in the simulator."
      }, {
