500\"\u003eMode:\u003c/span\u003e\n    \u003cselect \n      value\u003d{part.irMode || \u0027map\u0027} \n      onChange\u003d{(e) \u003d\u003e updatePart(part.id, \u0027irMode\u0027, e.target.value)} \n      disabled\u003d{isPinLocked}\n      className\u003d{`border border-gray-300 dark:border-neutral-700 rounded w-16 outline-none text-[9px] ${isPinLocked ? \u0027bg-gray-200 dark:bg-neutral-800 text-gray-400 cursor-not-allowed opacity-75\u0027 : \u0027bg-white dark:bg-neutral-950 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\u0027}`}\n    \u003e\n      \u003coption value\u003d\"map\"\u003eMap\u003c/option\u003e\n      \u003coption value\u003d\"object\"\u003eObject\u003c/option\u003e\n    \u003c/select\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n)}\n```",
