        "text": " }  \n  else if (pin \u003e\u003d 8 \u0026\u0026 pin \u003c\u003d 13) { pinAddr \u003d 0"
      }, {
        "text": "x23; bit \u003d pin - 8; } \n  else if (pin \u003e\u003d 14 \u0026\u0026"
      }, {
        "text": " pin \u003c\u003d 19) { pinAddr \u003d 0x26; bit \u003d pin - 14;"
      }, {
